  "notes": [
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section16817111413112",
      "text": "此接口用于新增/更新元服务的域名配置信息。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section16817111413112",
      "text": "接口调用者的角色：账号持有者、管理员、APP管理员、运营。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能介绍",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section16817111413112",
      "text": "新增超过10个业务域名时，建议先调用预检查业务域名配置接口确认是否可以新增成功。"
    },
    {
      "section": "服务器域名配置约束与限制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section1572199315",
      "text": "同一个元服务每个自然月服务器域名修改次数，默认为50次。"
    },
    {
      "section": "服务器域名配置约束与限制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section1572199315",
      "text": "单项服务器域名配置数量最多不超过200个。"
    },
    {
      "section": "服务器域名配置约束与限制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section1572199315",
      "text": "域名只支持HTTPS和WSS协议。"
    },
    {
      "section": "服务器域名配置约束与限制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section1572199315",
      "text": "域名不能使用IP地址或localhost。"
    },
    {
      "section": "服务器域名配置约束与限制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section1572199315",
      "text": "不可配置全局禁止清单内的域名。"
    },
    {
      "section": "业务域名配置约束与限制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section5605815161218",
      "text": "同一个元服务每个自然月业务域名修改次数，默认为50次。"
    },
    {
      "section": "业务域名配置约束与限制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section5605815161218",
      "text": "同一个APPID下，最多支持配置100个业务域名；同一个业务域名最多可配置100个APPID。"
    },
    {
      "section": "业务域名配置约束与限制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section5605815161218",
      "text": "域名只支持HTTPS协议。"
    },
    {
      "section": "业务域名配置约束与限制",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section5605815161218",
      "text": "网页内iframe的域名也需要配置。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section236517415165",
      "text": "本接口支持使用Service Account方式和API客户端方式，二者区别请参见获取服务端授权。"
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section236517415165",
      "text": "Service Account方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section236517415165",
      "text": "API客户端方式："
    },
    {
      "section": "请求参数",
      "sourceUrl": "https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/app/agc-help-domain-api-post-domain-0000002236041522#section141117691213",
